# Native libs are build artifacts produced by mruby-shared/xmake (its after_build
# hook copies them next to the .NET projects). They must NOT be committed: a stale
# binary here silently shadows the freshly built one and makes `dotnet test` run
# against outdated native code. CI (main.yml / publish.yml) always rebuilds them
# from source, so the working copy is regenerated on every build.
libmruby_x64.dll
libmruby_x64.so
libmruby_x64.dylib
libmruby_x64